IMILAB / Mijia EC2 cameras for Home Assistant
Copyright (c) 2026 perseus177

This product distributes, as release artifacts, binaries built from go2rtc:

    go2rtc - https://github.com/AlexxIT/go2rtc
    Copyright (c) 2022 Alexey Khit
    Licensed under the MIT License

Those binaries are built from a fork that adds support for IMILAB / Mijia EC2
battery cameras (chuangmi.gateway.ipc011). The change is offered upstream as
AlexxIT/go2rtc#2446; until it is merged, this project ships its own build so
that users do not depend on that decision.

    Fork: https://github.com/perseus177/go2rtc (branch xiaomi-ec2-support)

No go2rtc source is vendored into this repository. The binaries are produced by
.github/workflows/build-go2rtc.yml directly from the fork, and the integration
verifies the published SHA-256 checksum before executing one.
